<title>USA: Finish Line Inc Q2 Aug 31 net higher.</title>
<headline>Finish Line Inc Q2 Aug 31 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months	 Six Months</p>
<p>					 1996    1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net Sales		     $ 91,006$ 64,584 $162,750 $116,803</p>
<p>Cost of Sales (including</p>
<p>  occupancy expenses)	  61,543  44,895  111,755   81,236</p>
<p> Gross profit		    29,463  19,689   50,995   35,567</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expenses    19,037  14,015   35,079   26,373</p>
<p>Interest expense (income)(net)</p>
<p>					(137)     229	 57	359</p>
<p> Income before income taxes  10,563   5,445   15,859    8,835</p>
<p> Income taxes		     4,225   2,178    6,344    3,534</p>
<p> Net income			 6,338   3,267    9,515    5,301</p>
<p>Fully diluted weighted average</p>
<p>  shares outstanding (1)     11,775  10,385   11,234   10,353</p>
<p>Fully diluted net income</p>
<p>  per share (1)		    0.54    0.31     0.85     0.51</p>
<p>	    (In thousands, except per share and store data)</p>
<p>(1) Fully diluted weighted average shares outstanding and earnings per share do not reflect a 2-for-1 stock split payable November 15, 1996, record October 18, 1996.</p>
<p>NOTE: Finish Line had 235 stores open at August 31, 1996, up from 204 at the same time last year.</p>
<p>	     Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
